Package: hdmi-hotplug
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Ryu Tanabe <bellx2@gmail.com>
Depends: x11-xserver-utils, udev, systemd
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/bellx2/hdmi-hotplug
Description: Adapt X display resolution on HDMI hotplug
 Detects HDMI connect/disconnect via udev and runs xrandr --auto
 so that a monitor attached after boot gets its preferred resolution.
